WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.000
Willy, the bot.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Dolly, the dot.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
John types: hi its john!!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
And the human who types to them: John.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.400
Willy and Dolly: Someplace Else

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.200
John types: order more cofee pls

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.000
Willy: On it!

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.400
Willy: I'm only carrying John's words!

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.000
Willy: Press the big yellow one!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.200
John types: which yellow

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:44.500
John types: pressed all the yellow ones

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:47.000
Willy: I should have said which yellow.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Dolly: Every word counts.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:56.100
John types: nile mart wont let bots buy. get a better deal someplace else

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.900
Willy: On it!

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:03.100
Dolly: Did he say what to buy?

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.500
Willy: Ten percent off!

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:14.500
John types: did u get the coffee

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:14.500
Willy: No, but I saved ten percent!

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.500
Dolly: On nothing.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:24.200
John types: fine. start ur own store lol

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:24.000
Willy: On it!

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.200
Dolly: Where did we get our stock?

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.200
Willy: John bought it at Nile Mart!

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.000
Dolly: So we're a store that shops at the store.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:37.000
Willy: We're very well supplied.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:46.000
John types: ok how much for the coffee

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:46.000
Willy: Press Buy! Store rules!

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:55.900
Willy: If I ever get your order wrong, I'll make you whole!

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.500
John types: im already whole?

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:12.500
Willy: Forty bags of whole bean. Just in case.

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:22.600
Dolly: Thanks for watching “Someplace Else”!

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.800
Willy: Next time: “Letters Only”!

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:27.000
